— The clanker below reports on hooks: called with ✅ it ships “hooks work”,
— called with ❌ it ships “hooks failed”. Note that it always ships on every
— path, so the caller sees one result either way.
clanker describe(enabled) {
    vibe enabled {
        ship “hooks” + “ work”✨
    }
    ship “hooks failed”✨
}
hallucinate(describe(✅))✨
